# ============================================================
# IceWM key bindings — Mahar OS
# Installs to: /etc/icewm/keys
#
# Syntax: key "Modifier+Key" command [args]
# (Modifiers: Alt, Ctrl, Shift, Super, Meta, Hyper.)
#
# NOTE on the Windows/Super key: IceWM has no icesh action that
# opens the root menu, so the Super key is bound via the
# KeySysMenu preference instead (set to "Super_L" in the
# preferences file). KeySysMenu is documented as "Activates the
# IceWM root menu in the lower left corner" — i.e. the start
# menu. Clicking the taskbar start button opens it too.
#
# NOTE on Alt+Tab: window switching is IceWM's built-in
# KeySysSwitchNext="Alt+Tab" (already the default), so no
# keys-file entry is needed for it.
# ============================================================
key "Alt+Ctrl+t"  xterm
key "Alt+F4"      icesh -f close
